{
  "name": "BestClassicWB printing icons",
  "version": "2.1.12",
  "baseline": "2.1.12",
  "archives": {},
  "runtimeDependencies": [
    "AmigaOS Workbench"
  ],
  "notes": [
    "Owns 80 checked BCWB icons for the two Printers drawers, 58 added drivers, 15 AmigaOS drivers, three preferences editors and two tools.",
    "AmigaOS supplies Printer, PrinterGfx, PrinterPS, InitPrinter, PrintFiles and printer.device. The overlay supplies no executable or saved printer preferences.",
    "The shared Devs, Storage, Storage/Printers, Prefs and Tools drawers are outside this overlay. Tools/CMD.info stays with the shared BCWB assets."
  ],
